   <h2>Your files never leave your device</h2>
   <p>Every PDF and image you add is processed inside your browser. We never receive, store, or see your files, their names, or their contents: Cornerfold’s code never sends them anywhere. As a second safeguard, the site’s security policy tells your browser to block the usual ways a web page reaches other websites, such as loading scripts or images from them or sending them data requests. And after your first visit, the app works with your internet connection switched off.</p>
